---
import '../styles/prototype-inbox.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>TossBox · 地圖優先 Prototype</title>
    <meta name="description" content="TossBox 地圖優先 PlaceResolution 收藏決策流程 prototype。" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="app" aria-label="TossBox prototype">
      <div class="map" aria-label="模擬地圖"><div class="river"></div><div class="district d1"></div><div class="district d2"></div><div class="district d3"></div><span class="label one">中山</span><span class="label two">松山</span><span class="label three">大安</span><span class="label four">萬華</span></div>
      <p class="prototype-note">資料為有限模擬資料；不會取得位置、連線更新或開啟導航。</p>
      <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <header class="topbar"><div class="brand" aria-label="TossBox">tb</div><button class="search" id="searchBtn" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><span id="searchText">台北車站附近</span><small>搜尋目的地</small></button><button class="account-button" id="accountBtn" type="button" aria-label="開啟登入與工作階段" aria-haspopup="dialog">登入</button><button class="inbox-button" id="inboxBtn" type="button" aria-label="開啟收件匣" aria-haspopup="dialog">✦</button></header>
      <nav class="controls" aria-label="篩選"><button class="chip active" type="button" data-filter="all"><span class="dot"></span>全部</button><button class="chip" type="button" data-filter="food">吃東西</button><button class="chip" type="button" data-filter="coffee">咖啡甜點</button><button class="chip" type="button" data-filter="walk">走走逛逛</button></nav>
      <div class="status">📍 <b id="locationLabel">目前附近（模擬）</b> · 不使用定位權限</div><button class="locate" id="locate" type="button" aria-label="回到目前位置（模擬）">⌖</button>
      <div id="pins" aria-label="地圖地點"></div>
      <section class="sheet" aria-label="附近的確認地點"><div class="grab"></div><div class="sheet-head"><div><div class="eyebrow" id="sheetEyebrow">台北車站附近</div><div class="title">先選一個，出發吧</div></div><span class="count" id="count">0 個地點</span></div><div class="cards" id="cards"></div></section>

      <section class="modal" id="searchDialog" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="searchDialogTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="dialog-panel"><div class="modal-top"><div><h2 class="dialog-title" id="searchDialogTitle">搜尋目的地</h2><p class="dialog-copy">從有限的模擬區域與地點中選擇；不會查詢外部服務。</p></div><button class="close" type="button" data-close="searchDialog" aria-label="關閉搜尋">×</button></div><form class="search-field" id="destinationForm"><input id="destinationInput" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="例如：台北車站、松山文創" /><button class="button primary" type="submit">搜尋</button></form><div class="areas" id="areaOptions"></div></div></section>

      <section class="modal" id="detail" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="detailName" aria-hidden="true"><div class="dialog-panel detail-panel"><div class="modal-top"><span class="eyebrow" id="detailType">已確認地點</span><time class="detail-time" id="detailTimestamp"></time><button class="retry quiet-retry" id="freshnessRetry" type="button" hidden>重試更新</button><button class="close" type="button" data-close="detail" aria-label="關閉地點詳情">×</button></div><div class="detail-summary"><h1 class="detail-title" id="detailName"></h1><p class="detail-sub" id="detailAddress"></p><div class="facts"><div class="fact"><b id="detailRating"></b><span id="detailReviews"></span> 則模擬評價</div><div class="fact"><b id="detailPrice"></b>價格級別</div></div></div><section class="section visual-section"><div class="carousel" id="imageCarousel" aria-label="示意圖片" tabindex="0"></div><p class="visual-caption">示意圖片，非店家實拍。</p></section><section class="section place-state"><div class="visit-row"><label class="visit-toggle"><input id="visitedToggle" type="checkbox" /><span>已去過</span></label><span class="open-count" id="openCount"></span></div><label class="note-label" for="placeNote">我的備註</label><textarea id="placeNote" maxlength="360" rows="3" placeholder="新增備註（僅儲存在這個瀏覽器）"></textarea><p class="note-status" id="noteStatus" aria-live="polite"></p></section><section class="section"><h3>這筆收藏從哪裡來？</h3><div class="source"><i>◒</i><p><strong id="sourceTitle"></strong><br /><span id="sourceText"></span></p></div></section><section class="section"><h3>其他辨識候選</h3><div class="candidate-list" id="candidateList"></div></section><div class="actions"><button class="button secondary" id="sourceButton" type="button">查看模擬來源</button><button class="button primary" id="navigate" type="button">Google Maps（不開啟）↗</button></div></div></section>

      <section class="modal" id="authDialog" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="authTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="dialog-panel auth-panel"><div class="modal-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">本機 prototype</p><h2 class="dialog-title" id="authTitle">登入 TossBox</h2><p class="dialog-copy" id="authCopy">此畫面依照帳號與密碼登入契約設計，但不會連線、傳送或儲存帳密。</p></div><button class="close" type="button" data-close="authDialog" aria-label="關閉登入">×</button></div><section id="authSignedOut"><form id="authForm" class="auth-form" novalidate><label for="accountInput">帳號</label><input id="accountInput" name="account" type="text" maxlength="4096" autocomplete="username" aria-describedby="accountError" /><p class="field-error" id="accountError" aria-live="polite"></p><label for="passwordInput">密碼</label><div class="password-row"><input id="passwordInput" name="password" type="password" maxlength="4096" autocomplete="current-password" aria-describedby="passwordError" /><button id="passwordToggle" class="password-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false">顯示</button></div><p class="field-error" id="passwordError" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="authSubmit" class="button primary" type="submit">登入</button></form><p class="auth-feedback" id="authFeedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="authRetry" class="button secondary" type="button" hidden>重新嘗試（僅本機）</button><details class="demo-controls"><summary>展示登入結果（僅本機）</summary><p>不需要輸入帳密；登入工作階段只存在記憶體，重新整理即結束。</p><div><button type="button" data-auth-demo="success">模擬成功</button><button type="button" data-auth-demo="invalid">模擬憑證錯誤</button><button type="button" data-auth-demo="rate-limited">模擬速率限制</button><button type="button" data-auth-demo="unavailable">模擬服務失敗</button></div></details></section><section id="authActive" hidden><p class="session-state" id="sessionState"></p><p class="dialog-copy">不顯示或推測帳戶身分；此 prototype 不代表真實權限，也不會同步你的本機備註。</p><div class="actions"><button class="button secondary" id="expireSession" type="button">模擬工作階段過期</button><button class="button primary" id="logoutBtn" type="button">登出</button></div></section></div></section>

      <section class="modal" id="inboxDialog" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="inboxTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="dialog-panel inbox-panel"><div class="modal-top"><div><h2 class="dialog-title" id="inboxTitle">收件匣</h2><p class="dialog-copy">只保留還需要處理的來源；已確認地點會出現在地圖與清單。</p></div><button class="close" type="button" data-close="inboxDialog" aria-label="關閉收件匣">×</button></div><div class="inbox-list" id="inboxList" aria-live="polite"></div><form class="url-form" id="urlForm" novalidate><label for="sourceUrl">新增來源網址</label><input id="sourceUrl" inputmode="url" placeholder="https://example.com/post" aria-describedby="urlMessage" /><p class="form-message" id="urlMessage" aria-live="polite"></p><button class="button secondary" type="submit">只驗證格式</button></form><p class="prototype-banner">此欄位只做本機格式驗證，不發出請求，也不呈現輸入的原始 HTML。</p></div></section>
    </main>
    <script src="../scripts/prototype.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
